{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The game doesn't have matchmaking or single-player campaign, and should be played with friends.</i></strong><i><br>However, there is the option to create and potentially join public lobbies from the community.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/c7ab458408d2839f4f7f27fa84737096.avif?t=1771971476\" width=586 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are either the target or pursuer, or both... Find your target without being detected by other players. Distinguish who is real vs who is an NPC.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the crowd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use defensive abilities to trick players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use interactive environment props like gates to escape</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/a4616665571d0d71d40b203e1127bff0.avif?t=1771971476\" width=586 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blend in or go rouge, the choice is yours.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use offensive abilities to track down your target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the map and gain the high ground</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful as you may reveal your position</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/d6a9415729766461726b572db35405e5.avif?t=1771971476\" width=586 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate and collect hints. Be on the lookout for visual and audio cues. Check your map for intel on you target's whereabouts.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds scattered across the map that reveal last known target location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target portrait lights up when in line of sight</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/d54133fba33215e498f735c1862defb5.avif?t=1771971476\" width=586 height=200 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a combination of offensive and defensive abilities to gain the upper hand.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged Attack - Useful against players in hard to reach areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confuse - Inverts a player's controls for a short duration\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguise - Change your character's look to deceive players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clone - Lure players with a lookalike that chases a selected target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warp - Make yourself invisible temporarily</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel: 2 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag: 3 - 4 players</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3359650?t=1771971476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771971476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3